  "article": [
    { "en": "I used to travel by air a great deal when I was a boy.", "zh": "我小的时候经常乘飞机旅行。" },
    { "en": "My parents used to live in South America, and I flew there from Europe in the holidays.", "zh": "我的父母过去住在南美洲，我假期常从欧洲飞往那里。" },
    { "en": "I am used to travelling by air, and only once have I ever felt frightened.", "zh": "我习惯了乘飞机旅行，只有一次我感到过害怕。" },
    { "en": "After taking off, the plane was flying low over the city and slowly gaining height.", "zh": "起飞后，飞机在城市上空低空飞行，缓缓爬升。" },
    { "en": "Suddenly the plane turned round and flew back to the airport.", "zh": "突然，飞机掉头飞回了机场。" },
    { "en": "A flight attendant told us to keep calm and to get off the plane quietly as soon as it touched down.", "zh": "空中乘务员告诉我们保持镇静，飞机一着陆就安静地走下飞机。" },
    { "en": "Everybody on board was worried, and we all wanted to know what had happened.", "zh": "机上人人都很担心，大家都想知道发生了什么事。" },
    { "en": "Later we learnt that the police had been told about a bomb on the plane.", "zh": "后来我们得知，有人告诉警方飞机上有一枚炸弹。" },
    { "en": "After we had landed, the plane was searched thoroughly, but nothing was found.", "zh": "我们着陆后，飞机被彻底搜查了一遍，但什么也没找到。" },
    { "en": "Five hours later, we were able to take off again.", "zh": "5个小时后，我们又能重新起飞了。" }
  ]
